{"seq":1,"slug":"material-damage-dimweight-tradeoff","title":"包材成本/破损率/体积重权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cost-damage-balance/material-damage-dimweight-tradeoff","wordCount":2453,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"包材成本-破损率-体积重权衡\">包材成本/破损率/体积重权衡</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>包装决策的本质是一个三向权衡：<strong>多花包材钱买保护</strong>、<strong>少花包材钱但承担破损</strong>、<strong>无论怎么选都要付体积重的运费</strong>。这三者不是同一个量纲——包材是确定性的现金支出，破损是概率性的理赔支出，体积重是按件计的空间成本。把它们放在一张纸上比较，需要一个统一的期望成本函数。</p>\n<p>这个函数一旦建立，&quot;该用什么包材&quot;就从经验判断变成了可优化的问题。更有价值的是它还能回答反直觉的问题：某类商品的破损率已经很低了，继续加固还有意义吗？答案取决于加固的边际成本与破损减少的边际收益谁更大——而不是取决于&quot;是否还能做得更安全&quot;。</p>\n<p>把这三项放到同一量纲上并不自然：包材支出是确定的现金，破损是概率性的赔付，体积重是按件计的空间成本。统一它们的依据是<strong>计费规则本身</strong>——承运人的运费取决于体积重或实际重量中的较大者（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dimensional_weight\">Dimensional weight</a> 对&quot;按体积重与实际重量较大者计费&quot;的说明），所以体积项可以直接乘费率换算成钱，与包材支出相加没有歧义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[包材选择] --&gt; B[包材单价 × 用量]&#10;  A --&gt; C[保护强度]&#10;  C --&gt; D[破损率 p]&#10;  D --&gt; E[期望理赔 = p × 单件赔付]&#10;  A --&gt; F[外廓尺寸]&#10;  F --&gt; G[体积重 → 运费]&#10;  B --&gt; H[总期望成本]&#10;  E --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{边际比较}&#10;  I --&gt;|加固更省| J[升级包材]&#10;  I --&gt;|减材更省| K[降级包材]&#10;  J --&gt; A&#10;  K --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[包材选择] --&gt; B[包材单价 × 用量]\n  A --&gt; C[保护强度]\n  C --&gt; D[破损率 p]\n  D --&gt; E[期望理赔 = p × 单件赔付]\n  A --&gt; F[外廓尺寸]\n  F --&gt; G[体积重 → 运费]\n  B --&gt; H[总期望成本]\n  E --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{边际比较}\n  I --&gt;|加固更省| J[升级包材]\n  I --&gt;|减材更省| K[降级包材]\n  J --&gt; A\n  K --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"期望成本模型\">期望成本模型</h2><h3 id=\"三项之和\">三项之和</h3><p>单票的期望包装成本可以写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{exp} = C_{material} + p(a) \\cdot C_{claim} + \\lambda \\cdot W_{dim}(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ia</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 是保护等级（缓冲厚度、纸板克重、内衬配置），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{material}(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ia</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 单调增，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 单调减，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{dim}(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 也随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 增（因为更厚的保护通常意味着更大的外廓）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 是空间价格（见 <a href=\"../cartonization-algorithm/dimensional-weight-freight-link\">计费重 DIM 与运费成本联动</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{claim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是单件破损的完全成本。</p>\n<p>关键洞察是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{claim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> <strong>不等于商品的成本价</strong>。一件破损商品的真实代价包括：商品货值、往返运费、客服处理工时、平台罚款或差评带来的流量损失、以及跨境场景下的退运/销毁成本。把这些加起来，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{claim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 往往是货值的 1.5–3 倍量级（倍数因业务而异，需自家实测）。用成本价去算破损期望，会系统性地低估保护的价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"边际最优条件\">边际最优条件</h3><p>对上式关于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 求导取零，得到最优保护等级的条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\partial C_{material}}{\\partial a} + \\lambda \\frac{\\partial W_{dim}}{\\partial a} = -\\frac{\\partial p}{\\partial a} \\cdot C_{claim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ia</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">im</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>左边是加固的<strong>边际成本</strong>（材料 + 增加体积带来的运费），右边是<strong>边际收益</strong>（破损率下降乘以破损成本）。这个式子给出了一个非常实用的判据：只有当破损成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{claim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 足够大时，加固才划算。这解释了为什么高货值商品普遍过包装而低货值商品普遍欠包装——它们真的应该如此。</p>\n<h3 id=\"档位枚举的落地\">档位枚举的落地</h3><p>把边际条件落成代码，就是对有限包材档位做一次枚举加打分。这段逻辑和选箱算法共享同一个成本口径，因此必须调用同一个计费重函数，而不是各写一份——两份实现只要有一点取整差异，就会让&quot;包装评估建议换箱&quot;与&quot;选箱算法实际选的箱&quot;长期打架。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def evaluate_grades(sku, carton, grades, channel, p_prior):&#10;    best = None&#10;    for g in grades:                                  # g: cushion grade / board grade&#10;        outer = expand_outer(carton, g)               # 保护等级影响外廓&#10;        w_dim = dim_weight(outer, channel)            # 与选箱算法共用同一实现&#10;        w_charge = max(outer.gross_weight_g, w_dim)&#10;        freight = channel.rate_per_kg * w_charge / 1000.0&#10;        material = g.unit_cost_micro / 1e6&#10;        p = shrink(p_prior.for_grade(g), p_prior.parent, k=20)&#10;        claim = p * sku.full_claim_cost                   # 含退运/客服/罚款/流量损失&#10;        total = material + freight + claim&#10;        if best is None or total &lt; best.total:&#10;            best = GradeScore(g, material, freight, claim, total)&#10;    return best\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> evaluate_grades</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sku, carton, grades, channel, p_prior):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    best </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grades:                                  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># g: cushion grade / board grade</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        outer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expand_outer(carton, g)               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 保护等级影响外廓</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w_dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dim_weight(outer, channel)            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 与选箱算法共用同一实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        w_charge </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(outer.gross_weight_g, w_dim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        freight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel.rate_per_kg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w_charge </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        material </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g.unit_cost_micro </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shrink(p_prior.for_grade(g), p_prior.parent, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        claim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku.full_claim_cost                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 含退运/客服/罚款/流量损失</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> material </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freight </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> claim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best.total:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            best </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GradeScore(g, material, freight, claim, total)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>full_claim_cost</code> 是这段代码里唯一需要业务方反复校准的输入，也是整个模型的杠杆点：它每高估 20%，模型就会系统性地多推荐一档保护。可行的校准方式是拿历史理赔数据反推——用已发生的破损案例回算&quot;若当时升一档，能省下多少&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"离散化与包材档位\">离散化与包材档位</h3><p>现实中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 不是连续变量，而是有限的包材档位（箱型 × 缓冲等级的笛卡尔积）。所以实践上是枚举档位、计算每档的期望成本、取最小，而不是求解导数。这也是为什么包材目录里每个档位都要有<strong>可信的破损率先验</strong>——没有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(a)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，枚举无从比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"破损率的测量\">破损率的测量</h2><h3 id=\"分层的破损率\">分层的破损率</h3><p>破损率必须分层，否则会被平均值掩盖。至少按三个维度分层：<strong>商品品类</strong>（脆值不同）、<strong>包材档位</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 不同）、<strong>运输链路</strong>（不同渠道的搬运粗暴程度不同）。任意一层内的样本太少时，用贝叶斯收缩向上一层均值靠拢，避免个别品类因为几件破损就得出极端结论。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{shrunk} = \\frac{n \\cdot p_{obs} + k \\cdot p_{parent}}{n + k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">nk</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是收缩强度（伪计数），按数据量自定。这是把稀疏数据变得可用的标准做法，比&quot;样本不足就不显示&quot;要负责任得多。</p>\n<p>分层、收缩与用途三件事要一次定清楚，否则指标会在不同报表间对不上：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>分母口径</th>\n<th>分层粒度</th>\n<th>是否收缩</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成本决策</td>\n<td>金额</td>\n<td>品类 × 档位 × 链路</td>\n<td>是（按档位收缩）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商考核</td>\n<td>件数</td>\n<td>供应商 × 品类</td>\n<td>是（按供应商收缩）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事故复盘</td>\n<td>件数 + 金额</td>\n<td>到单票</td>\n<td>否（保留原始明细）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>同一份破损数据在不同用途下的正确形态不同，这是很常见的争议来源：成本团队看到的是收缩后的稳定值，复盘会议看的是未收缩的原始明细，两边数字不一致时容易互相怀疑数据造假。解决办法是在数据字典里显式声明每个派生指标的口径与收缩参数，而不是让每个团队各自算一遍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归因与闭环\">归因与闭环</h3><p>破损归因的难点在于破损往往在末端才被发现，而原因发生在中段的某次跌落或挤压。可行的近似是把破损记录里能拿到的所有维度（承运人、渠道、时刻、包材档位、装载位置）都打上，然后做多维交叉找异常。装载位置尤其值得单独看——如果破损集中出现在托盘的边角或底层，那问题在装载而不在包材，改包材是治错了病。</p>\n<h2 id=\"减材策略\">减材策略</h2><h3 id=\"从哪减起\">从哪减起</h3><p>减材（material reduction）的收益是双份的：直接省包材钱，以及缩小外廓带来的体积重下降。所以减材的优先级通常高于加固。减材的位置按收益排序大致是：<strong>箱壁过多的空腔</strong>（选小一档箱）、<strong>过量的填充</strong>（改善摆放而非加填充）、<strong>过厚的缓冲</strong>（在验证支持下降级）、<strong>过重的纸板克重</strong>（在承压达标前提下降级）。</p>\n<p>每一步减材必须有验证支撑，否则就是把成本从包材科目转移到理赔科目——财务报表上看起来省了钱，实际总额更高。这就是为什么第 1 章的 <a href=\"../dimension-packaging-masterdata/packing-spec-fragile-special-reinforce\">包装规范与加固</a> 强调验证方式必须写进规则：它正是减材的依据来源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"轻量化的验证与回归\">轻量化的验证与回归</h3><p>没有验证的减材不可逆——等到破损数据显形，可能已经发了几个月的货。所以减材必须走<strong>小批量验证</strong>：选一个可控的子集（例如某个仓库、某条渠道）先切换，观察破损率与成本两周到一个月，无异常再全面推开。这个流程和任何灰度发布一样，只是观察指标换成了破损率与运费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标口径\">指标口径</h2><h3 id=\"三个必须钉住的口径\">三个必须钉住的口径</h3><p><strong>破损率</strong>：分母是件数还是金额？两者会给出相反结论（高货值件数少但金额大）。建议同时报告，且主考核指标用金额口径，因为它直接对应成本。</p>\n<p><strong>包材成本率</strong>：包材支出除以发货件数或销售额。按件数看的是运营效率，按销售额看的是结构影响（高货值商品会天然拉低这个比率）。</p>\n<p><strong>体积重占比</strong>：计费重中体积重超过实重的票数占比，或者说&quot;泡货比例&quot;。这个指标上升说明整体装载变差了，即使单票都在优化范围内。</p>\n<h3 id=\"指标之间的勾稽\">指标之间的勾稽</h3><p>三个口径之间要有勾稽关系，否则各自优化会互相打架。一个简单的勾稽是：包材成本率下降的同时体积重占比不应上升，否则说明减材是在通过缩小箱体转移成本，而不是真的改善。破损率的下降也不应伴随包材成本率的等价上升，否则只是买保险。这些勾稽关系是评审包装优化项目是否真实有效的最直接检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>包装决策是三向权衡，需用统一期望成本函数比较：包材支出 + 破损期望 + 体积重运费。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{claim}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">aim</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远大于货值（含退运、客服、罚款、流量损失），用成本价估会严重低估保护价值。</li>\n<li>边际最优条件说明高货值商品本就该过包装，这不是浪费而是理性。</li>\n<li>破损率必须按品类、包材档位、链路分层，稀疏层用贝叶斯收缩。</li>\n<li>破损归因要包含装载位置维度，否则可能把装载问题误诊为包材问题。</li>\n<li>减材优先级高于加固，但必须有验证与灰度，否则只是把成本从包材搬到理赔。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸\">延伸</h2><p>减材落到&quot;材有多轻&quot;之外还要看&quot;装得多满&quot;，见 <a href=\"lightweighting-load-rate-metric\">减材轻量化与装载率指标</a>；支撑破损率测量的实测数据来自 DWS 与拣包产线，见 <a href=\"pack-throughput-dws-automation\">拣包产能与 DWS 称重量方自动化</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"包材成本/破损率/体积重权衡","id":"包材成本-破损率-体积重权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"期望成本模型","id":"期望成本模型"},{"level":3,"text":"三项之和","id":"三项之和"},{"level":3,"text":"边际最优条件","id":"边际最优条件"},{"level":3,"text":"档位枚举的落地","id":"档位枚举的落地"},{"level":3,"text":"离散化与包材档位","id":"离散化与包材档位"},{"level":2,"text":"破损率的测量","id":"破损率的测量"},{"level":3,"text":"分层的破损率","id":"分层的破损率"},{"level":3,"text":"归因与闭环","id":"归因与闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"减材策略","id":"减材策略"},{"level":3,"text":"从哪减起","id":"从哪减起"},{"level":3,"text":"轻量化的验证与回归","id":"轻量化的验证与回归"},{"level":2,"text":"指标口径","id":"指标口径"},{"level":3,"text":"三个必须钉住的口径","id":"三个必须钉住的口径"},{"level":3,"text":"指标之间的勾稽","id":"指标之间的勾稽"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸","id":"延伸"}],"prev":{"title":"混装隔离与限重/堆叠约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/pallet-container-loading/mixed-load-separation-stack-limit"},"next":{"title":"拣包产能与 DWS 称重量方自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/packaging-loading-optimization/cost-damage-balance/pack-throughput-dws-automation"}}